[C][B][FFFFFF]┃ ➤ /s2 [00FFFF]» spam v1
[C][B][FFFFFF]┃ ➤ /s3 [00FFFF]» spam v2
[C][B][FFFFFF]┃ ➤ /s4 [00FFFF]» spam moderator
[C][B][FFFFFF]┃ ➤ /s5 [00FFFF]» spam sp
[B][C]{h1_color}╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯"""

                    h2 = f"""[B][C]{h2_color}╭━━━〔 GAME COMMANDS 〕━━━╮
[C][B][FFFFFF]┃ ➤ /e <name> [00FFFF]» Named Emote
