[C][B][FFFFFF]┃ ➤ /gali <name> [00FFFF]» Gaali Messages
[C][B][FFFFFF]┃ ➤ /rt <name> [00FFFF]» Roast
[C][B][FFFFFF]┃ ➤ /praisa <name> [00FFFF]» Praise
[C][B][FFFFFF]┃ ➤ /later <name> [00FFFF]» Love Letter
[C][B][FFFFFF]┃ ➤ /sadlater <name> [00FFFF]» Sad Letter
